-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ג/8 — קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ג בחטיבה העליונה (31.7.2013)
-- The clothing allowance for school year תשע"ג in the upper division: the
-- general allowance (level 4), the additional allowance for physical-
-- education teachers by position size, and the shoes-and-coats allowance in
-- technological education by subject; all pro-rated to the position.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT conventions

§ `חוזר תשע"ג/8 קצובת ביגוד תשע"ג בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 States the circular's purpose; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 Says the rules below follow the Treasury's instructions on clothing; they are the sections that follow.

DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    `upper division`
    `grades 13-14`
    `another stage`

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשע"ג as the clothing allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`   IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching-employees grading
    `employed by a supervised owner`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `stage`                           IS A `stage of education`
    `positions`                       IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the position held with each employer (1 = a full position), one entry per employer
    `teaches physical education`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `physical-education position`     IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a position in physical education
    `technological subjects`          IS A LIST OF STRING @desc the subjects taught in technological education or as a vocational instructor, as the lists print them; empty for none

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the total position` y IS
    sum (y's `positions`)

-- ¶15: the circular applies to teaching employees of supervised owners in
-- the upper division and grades 13-14.
@ref akn:preamble/p15
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` y IF
        y's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND y's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND (   y's `stage` EQUALS `upper division`
         OR y's `stage` EQUALS `grades 13-14`)

§§ `א. קצובת ביגוד – כללי`

-- akn:art_a Heading of section א; no rule of its own.

DECLARE `clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance in full` HAS `clothing paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the additional clothing allowances` HAS `amount of the additional allowances paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ above the cap` HAS `position employed` IS A NUMBER

-- א.2: entitled as public-facing workers in the civil service are, for
-- school year תשע"ג (09/12-08/13).
@ref akn:art_a__para_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance` y IF
    `the circular applies to` y AND y's `graded as a teaching employee`

-- א.3: level 4, that is 2095.
@ref akn:art_a__para_3
`the level-4 allowance` MEANS 2095

-- א.4: pro-rated to the position, and no more than one full position.
@ref akn:art_a__para_4
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position share under א.4` y IS
    min (`the total position` y) 1

-- א.5: with more than one employer and above 100% in total, each employer
-- pays the allowance proportional to the position held with it.
@ref akn:art_a__para_5
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the total all employers pay under א.5` y IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD `the level-4 allowance` TIMES p) (y's `positions`))

-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-a: two employers, 70% and 60%: א.4 caps at one
-- position, א.5 makes each pay its own share.
`seventy and sixty percent with two employers` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `upper division`
        `positions`                      IS LIST 0.7, 0.6
        `teaches physical education`     IS FALSE
        `physical-education position`    IS 0
        `technological subjects`         IS EMPTY

`א.4 and א.5 give different allowances for two employers above a full position` MEANS
    NOT (`the total all employers pay under א.5` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers`
         EQUALS `the level-4 allowance` TIMES `the position share under א.4` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers`)
#ASSERT `א.4 and א.5 give different allowances for two employers above a full position`

-- The reading adopted: א.5 for more than one employer, א.4 for one.
@export default The general clothing allowance for school year תשע"ג in the upper division under circular תשע"ג/8
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year` @desc the employee's school year
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `general clothing allowance` y IS
    IF NOT `entitled to the clothing allowance` y
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF count (y's `positions`) GREATER THAN 1
         THEN `the total all employers pay under א.5` y
         ELSE `the level-4 allowance` TIMES `the position share under א.4` y

-- א.1: paid in full with the salary of July 2013. Time in school months
-- (September 2012 = 1, July 2013 = 11).
-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-e: only section א, headed "כללי", names the month of
-- payment; sections ב and ג name none. The reading adopted, by convention
-- dates.no-deadline (conventions.toml): July binds the general allowance of
-- section א, the part its heading names; the additional allowances of
-- sections ב and ג are owed with no deadline, since no stated time is no
-- deadline.
@ref akn:art_a__para_1
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `the clothing allowance paid with July's salary` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance in full` amount
          PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `general clothing allowance` y
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ג/8, א.1: the clothing allowance is paid in full with the salary of July 2013"

@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_c__para_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the additional allowances` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowances` `additional amount`
          PROVIDED `additional amount` AT LEAST `physical-education allowance` y PLUS `technological clothing allowance` y
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "sections ב and ג name no month: the additional allowances are owed with no deadline"

-- א.6: no teaching employee works above 140% with all employers together,
-- and nothing above is a permit to employ beyond it.
@ref akn:art_a__para_6
`the cap on the position with all employers` MEANS 140%

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment above 140%` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `employ above the cap` p PROVIDED p GREATER THAN `the cap on the position with all employers`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ג/8, א.6: no teaching employee works above 140% with all employers"

§§ `ב. חינוך גופני`

-- ב ¶1: the amounts of circular תשע"ב/8 are updated as the table below.
-- The table AS PRINTED: "עד 0.3", "מ-0.3 עד 0.5", "מ-0.5 ומעלה" — 999
-- stands for "ומעלה".
@ref akn:art_b/p1 akn:art_b/t1
DECLARE `physical-education band` HAS
    `band from position` IS A NUMBER
    `band to position`   IS A NUMBER
    `band amount`        IS A NUMBER

`the physical-education table` MEANS
    LIST `physical-education band` 0   0.3 0,
         `physical-education band` 0.3 0.5 669,
         `physical-education band` 0.5 999 1334

GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the table gives for position` p IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD p AT LEAST b's `band from position` AND p AT MOST b's `band to position`)
                `the physical-education table`)

-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-b: positions of exactly 0.3 and 0.5 fall in two
-- rows each, with different amounts.
`the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each` MEANS
        `the amounts the table gives for position` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 669
    AND `the amounts the table gives for position` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 669, 1334
#ASSERT `the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each`

-- The reading adopted: a row governs from the position it opens at ("מ-"),
-- so 0.3 takes 669 and 0.5 takes 1334.
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the physical-education amount` p IS
    BRANCH IF p `has reached the row from` 0.5 THEN 1334
           IF p `has reached the row from` 0.3 THEN 669
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD `the amounts the table gives for position` p EQUALS LIST (`the physical-education amount` p))
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.4, 0.49, 0.51, 0.8, 1)

-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-d: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position. The
-- reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_08-c and its siblings read the same
-- words: the share in physical education, the input
-- `physical-education position`.
`the two readings of the employment rate differ` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the table gives for position` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the table gives for position` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ`

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance` y IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance` y AND y's `teaches physical education`
    THEN `the physical-education amount` (y's `physical-education position`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `ג. חינוך טכנולוגי`

-- ג ¶1 and ג.1(א): a teacher or vocational instructor in technological
-- education in one of these subjects gets a pair of shoes and two coats a
-- year, worth 550. The table's two columns, in their printed numbering 1-13.
@ref akn:art_c/p1 akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a/t1
`the shoes-and-coats subjects` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה", "מכטרוניקה", "טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית", "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות", "מערכות מכונאות רכב", "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה", "מערכות בקרת אקלים", "אומנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות", "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע", "מערכות צילום"

@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_a/p2
`the value of a pair of shoes and two coats` MEANS 550

-- ג.1(ב): in these subjects, two coats a year, worth 341.
@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b/t1
`the two-coats subjects` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות", "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה", "מערכות מחשבים", "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה", "ניהול תיירותי", "ניהול מלונאי", "חינוך לגיל הרך", "עיצוב",
         "אופנה ותלבושות", "עיצוב שיער, וטיפוח החן", "סיעוד", "אומנות שימושית"

@ref akn:art_c__para_1__subpara_b/p2
`the value of two coats` MEANS 341

#ASSERT count `the shoes-and-coats subjects` EQUALS 13
#ASSERT count `the two-coats subjects` EQUALS 13

GIVEN subjects IS A LIST OF STRING
      y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a subject on` subjects y IF
    any (GIVEN t YIELD elem t subjects) (y's `technological subjects`)

-- ג.2: in addition to the general allowance; ג.3: pro-rated to the
-- position, no more than one full position.
-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-c: a teacher of subjects on both lists meets ג.1(א)
-- and ג.1(ב). The reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_13-c and its siblings
-- read the same words: the larger grant, which holds the two coats the
-- other grants.
@ref akn:art_c__para_2 akn:art_c__para_3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance` y IS
    IF NOT `entitled to the clothing allowance` y
    THEN 0
    ELSE BRANCH IF `teaches a subject on` `the shoes-and-coats subjects` y
                THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats` TIMES `the position share under א.4` y
                IF `teaches a subject on` `the two-coats subjects` y
                THEN `the value of two coats` TIMES `the position share under א.4` y
                OTHERWISE 0

-- The other reading: both grants, added, for a full position.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `both grants added` y IS
    (IF `teaches a subject on` `the shoes-and-coats subjects` y THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `teaches a subject on` `the two-coats subjects` y THEN `the value of two coats` ELSE 0)

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the larger grant` y IS
    BRANCH IF `teaches a subject on` `the shoes-and-coats subjects` y THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats`
           IF `teaches a subject on` `the two-coats subjects` y THEN `the value of two coats`
           OTHERWISE 0

-- akn:art_d The contact line for questions; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions The signature and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The employees are illustrations.
`a full-time PE teacher` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `upper division`
        `positions`                      IS LIST 1
        `teaches physical education`     IS TRUE
        `physical-education position`    IS 0.6
        `technological subjects`         IS EMPTY

`a half-time mechatronics teacher` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `upper division`
        `positions`                      IS LIST 0.5
        `teaches physical education`     IS FALSE
        `physical-education position`    IS 0
        `technological subjects`         IS LIST "מכטרוניקה"

#ASSERT `general clothing allowance` `a full-time PE teacher` EQUALS 2095
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance` `a full-time PE teacher` EQUALS 1334
#ASSERT `general clothing allowance` `a half-time mechatronics teacher` EQUALS 1047.5
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance` `a half-time mechatronics teacher` EQUALS 275
#EVAL   `general clothing allowance` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers`

#TRACE `the clothing allowance paid with July's salary` `a full-time PE teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in full` 3429 AT 11
#TRACE `no employment above 140%` `a full-time PE teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ above the cap` 1.5 AT 3

-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-f: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%` MEANS
    `the physical-education amount` 0.4 PLUS `the physical-education amount` 0.4
        GREATER THAN `the physical-education amount` 0.8
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80%`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: one employer at positions in tenths
-- from 0 to 1.5, or two at every pair in fifths to 1; physical-education
-- shares in tenths; every subject of either list, none, a subject on
-- neither, and one of each list; in the grade or not.

`tenths to 1.5` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 10) (range 0 15)
`fifths to 1` MEANS map (GIVEN k YIELD k DIVIDED BY 5) (range 0 5)
`both booleans` MEANS LIST TRUE, FALSE
`every subject list checked` MEANS
    append (LIST EMPTY, (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות"), (LIST "נושא אחר"))
           (map (GIVEN t YIELD LIST t) (append `the shoes-and-coats subjects` `the two-coats subjects`))

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN
      ps IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      r IS A NUMBER
      l IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A `clothing year`
DECIDE `a checked year` g ps e r l IS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS g
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `upper division`
        `positions`                      IS ps
        `teaches physical education`     IS e
        `physical-education position`    IS r
        `technological subjects`         IS l

-- ב over shares in tenths: every share is in some row, two exactly at 0.3
-- and 0.5 (F-2012-13_tashag_08-b, whole space), the amount is one of those
-- rows', it never falls, and it is nothing for a teacher of no physical
-- education. F-2012-13_tashag_08-d over the same shares: the two readings
-- part for a full-position teacher exactly below 0.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the table gives for position` r
                    a MEANS `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) TRUE r EMPTY)
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (r EQUALS 0.3 OR r EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) TRUE (r PLUS 0.1) EMPTY)
                    AND `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) FALSE r EMPTY) EQUALS 0
                    AND (NOT (a EQUALS `physical-education allowance` (`a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) TRUE 1 EMPTY)))
                        EQUALS (r LESS THAN 0.5))
            `tenths to 1.5`

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      p IS A NUMBER
      l IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `one employer holds for` y g p l IF
    LET a MEANS `general clothing allowance` y PLUS `technological clothing allowance` y
    IN      a AT LEAST 0
        AND a AT MOST `the level-4 allowance` PLUS `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats`
        AND (g OR a EQUALS 0)
        AND ((NOT g) OR p EQUALS 0 OR `general clothing allowance` y GREATER THAN 0)
        AND ((p LESS THAN 1) OR a EQUALS `general clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g (LIST (p PLUS 0.5)) FALSE 0 l)
                                       PLUS `technological clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g (LIST (p PLUS 0.5)) FALSE 0 l))
        AND a AT MOST `general clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g (LIST (p PLUS 0.1)) FALSE 0 l)
                      PLUS `technological clothing allowance` (`a checked year` g (LIST (p PLUS 0.1)) FALSE 0 l)

-- א and ג with one employer over every grade, position and subject list:
-- never negative, never above level 4 and the larger technological grant,
-- nothing outside the grade, something in it with a position, never falling
-- with a larger position, above one paying as one.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                        all (GIVEN l YIELD
                                `one employer holds for` (`a checked year` g (LIST p) FALSE 0 l) g p l)
                            `every subject list checked`)
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            `both booleans`

-- א.5 with two employers over every pair of positions in fifths: each pays
-- its own share, and together they pay more than one position's allowance
-- exactly where the positions add to more than one (F-2012-13_tashag_08-a,
-- whole space).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN q YIELD
                        LET y MEANS `a checked year` TRUE (LIST p, q) FALSE 0 EMPTY
                        IN      `general clothing allowance` y EQUALS `the level-4 allowance` TIMES (p PLUS q)
                            AND (`general clothing allowance` y GREATER THAN `the level-4 allowance`) EQUALS (p PLUS q GREATER THAN 1))
                    `fifths to 1`)
            `fifths to 1`

-- ג: no subject is on both lists; F-2012-13_tashag_08-c over every list
-- checked: the two readings part exactly for a teacher on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD NOT elem t `the two-coats subjects`) `the shoes-and-coats subjects`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                LET y MEANS `a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) FALSE 0 l
                IN  (NOT (`both grants added` y EQUALS `the larger grant` y))
                    EQUALS (`teaches a subject on` `the shoes-and-coats subjects` y AND `teaches a subject on` `the two-coats subjects` y))
            `every subject list checked`

`a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants` MEANS
    LET y MEANS `a checked year` TRUE (LIST 1) FALSE 0 (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות")
    IN      `teaches a subject on` `the shoes-and-coats subjects` y
        AND `teaches a subject on` `the two-coats subjects` y
        AND NOT (`both grants added` y EQUALS `the larger grant` y)
#ASSERT `a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants`

-- F-2012-13_tashag_08-e: of the three sections, only א names the month the
-- allowance is paid in.
`the months sections ב and ג name for payment` MEANS EMPTY
`sections ב and ג name no month of payment` MEANS
    `the months sections ב and ג name for payment` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `sections ב and ג name no month of payment`
